    "text": "WCAX\nwebsite\nPlattsburgh\nMayor’s Cup returns to Plattsburgh this weekend\nBy Alek LaShomb,\n8 hours agoPLATTSBURGH. N.Y. (WCAX) - The Sunrise Rotary’s Mayor’s Cup returns to Plattsburgh this weekend. Organizers and city officials say it will be a weekend packed full of activities, like yoga on the beach and the iconic regatta sailing competition out on Lake Champlain. All proceeds go to nonprofits...\n2",
